From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Baptiste Augrain <daiyam@zokugun.org>
Date: Sat, 1 Jan 2000 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: remove the bundled copilot extension and its build dependencies

VSCodium does not bundle the built-in Copilot extension, so its compile and packaging tasks, the ripgrep shim, platform prebuilds and postinstall wiring are dropped from gulpfile.vscode.ts and gulpfile.reh.ts, and the @github/copilot, copilot-sdk and copilot-api dependencies are stripped from the build.

